{"suttaId":"thag16.10","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[3503,3596],"vripara":"920"},"segments":{"thag16.10:0.4":"Pārāpariyattheragāthā","thag16.10:1.1":"Samaṇassa ahu cintā, pupphitamhi mahāvane;","thag16.10:1.3":"Ekaggassa nisinnassa, pavivittassa jhāyino.","thag16.10:2.1":"“Aññathā lokanāthamhi, tiṭṭhante purisuttame;","thag16.10:2.3":"Iriyaṃ āsi bhikkhūnaṃ, aññathā dāni dissati.","thag16.10:3.1":"“Sītavātaparittānaṃ, hirikopīnachādanaṃ;","thag16.10:3.3":"Mattaṭṭhiyaṃ abhuñjiṃsu, santuṭṭhā itarītare.","thag16.10:4.1":"“Paṇītaṃ yadi vā lūkhaṃ, appaṃ vā yadi vā bahuṃ;","thag16.10:4.3":"Yāpanatthaṃ abhuñjiṃsu, agiddhā nādhimucchitā.","thag16.10:5.1":"“Jīvitānaṃ parikkhāre, bhesajje atha paccaye;","thag16.10:5.3":"Na bāḷhaṃ ussukā āsuṃ, yathā te āsavakkhaye.","thag16.10:6.1":"“Araññe rukkhamūlesu, kandarāsu guhāsu ca;","thag16.10:6.3":"Vivekamanubrūhantā, vihaṃsu tapparāyanā.","thag16.10:7.1":"“Nīcā niviṭṭhā subharā, mudū atthaddhamānasā;","thag16.10:7.3":"Abyāsekā amukharā, atthacintā vasānugā.","thag16.10:8.1":"“Tato pāsādikaṃ āsi, gataṃ bhuttaṃ nisevitaṃ;","thag16.10:8.3":"Siniddhā teladhārāva, ahosi iriyāpatho.","thag16.10:9.1":"“Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, mahājhāyī mahāhitā;","thag16.10:9.3":"Nibbutā dāni te therā, parittā dāni tādisā.","thag16.10:10.1":"“Kusalānañca dhammānaṃ, paññāya ca parikkhayā;","thag16.10:10.3":"Sabbākāravarūpetaṃ, lujjate jinasāsanaṃ.","thag16.10:11.1":"“Pāpakānañca dhammānaṃ, kilesānañca yo utu;","thag16.10:11.3":"Upaṭṭhitā vivekāya, ye ca saddhammasesakā.","thag16.10:12.1":"“Te kilesā pavaḍḍhantā, āvisanti bahuṃ janaṃ;","thag16.10:12.3":"Kīḷanti maññe bālehi, ummattehiva rakkhasā.","thag16.10:13.1":"“Kilesehābhibhūtā te, tena tena vidhāvitā;","thag16.10:13.3":"Narā kilesavatthūsu, sasaṅgāmeva ghosite.","thag16.10:14.1":"“Pariccajitvā saddhammaṃ, aññamaññehi bhaṇḍare;","thag16.10:14.3":"Diṭṭhigatāni anventā, idaṃ seyyoti maññare.","thag16.10:15.1":"“Dhanañca puttaṃ bhariyañca, chaḍḍayitvāna niggatā;","thag16.10:15.3":"Kaṭacchubhikkhahetūpi, akicchāni nisevare.","thag16.10:16.1":"“Udarāvadehakaṃ bhutvā, sayantuttānaseyyakā;","thag16.10:16.3":"Kathaṃ vattenti [kathā vaḍḍhenti (sī. ka.)] paṭibuddhā, yā kathā satthugarahitā.","thag16.10:17.1":"“Sabbakārukasippāni, cittiṃ katvāna [cittīkatvāna (sī.), cittaṃ katvāna (syā.)] sikkhare;","thag16.10:17.3":"Avūpasantā ajjhattaṃ, sāmaññatthoti acchati [tiriñcati (?)].","thag16.10:18.1":"“Mattikaṃ telacuṇṇañca, udakāsanabhojanaṃ;","thag16.10:18.3":"Gihīnaṃ upanāmenti, ākaṅkhantā bahuttaraṃ.","thag16.10:19.1":"“Dantaponaṃ kapitthañca, pupphaṃ khādaniyāni ca;","thag16.10:19.3":"Piṇḍapāte ca sampanne, ambe āmalakāni ca.","thag16.10:20.1":"“Bhesajjesu yathā vejjā, kiccākicce yathā gihī;","thag16.10:20.3":"Gaṇikāva vibhūsāyaṃ, issare khattiyā yathā.","thag16.10:21.1":"“Nekatikā vañcanikā, kūṭasakkhī apāṭukā;","thag16.10:21.3":"Bahūhi parikappehi, āmisaṃ paribhuñjare.","thag16.10:22.1":"“Lesakappe pariyāye, parikappenudhāvitā;","thag16.10:22.3":"Jīvikatthā upāyena, saṅkaḍḍhanti bahuṃ dhanaṃ.","thag16.10:23.1":"“Upaṭṭhāpenti parisaṃ, kammato no ca dhammato;","thag16.10:23.3":"Dhammaṃ paresaṃ desenti, lābhato no ca atthato.","thag16.10:24.1":"“Saṅghalābhassa bhaṇḍanti, saṅghato paribāhirā;","thag16.10:24.3":"Paralābhopajīvantā, ahirīkā na lajjare.","thag16.10:25.1":"“Nānuyuttā tathā eke, muṇḍā saṅghāṭipārutā;","thag16.10:25.3":"Sambhāvanaṃyevicchanti, lābhasakkāramucchitā.","thag16.10:26.1":"“Evaṃ nānappayātamhi, na dāni sukaraṃ tathā;","thag16.10:26.3":"Aphusitaṃ vā phusituṃ, phusitaṃ vānurakkhituṃ.","thag16.10:27.1":"“Yathā kaṇṭakaṭṭhānamhi, careyya anupāhano;","thag16.10:27.3":"Satiṃ upaṭṭhapetvāna, evaṃ gāme munī care.","thag16.10:28.1":"“Saritvā pubbake yogī, tesaṃ vattamanussaraṃ;","thag16.10:28.3":"Kiñcāpi pacchimo kālo, phuseyya amataṃ padaṃ.","thag16.10:29.1":"“Idaṃ vatvā sālavane, samaṇo bhāvitindriyo;","thag16.10:29.3":"Brāhmaṇo parinibbāyī, isi khīṇapunabbhavo”ti.","thag16.10:29.5":"… Pārāpariyo [pārāsariyo (syā.)] thero ….","thag16.10:29.6":"Vīsatinipāto niṭṭhito.","thag16.10:30.0":"Tatruddānaṃ –","thag16.10:30.1":"Adhimutto pārāpariyo, telakāni raṭṭhapālo;","thag16.10:30.3":"Mālukyaselo bhaddiyo, aṅguli dibbacakkhuko.","thag16.10:30.5":"Pārāpariyo dasete, vīsamhi parikittitā;","thag16.10:30.7":"Gāthāyo dve satā honti, pañcatālīsa [244 gāthāyoyeva dissanti] uttarinti."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
